  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1sFio8F.png\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>Fancy Block Particles</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">是一款客户端模组，能将《我的世界》原版中的基础 2D 粒子变成酷炫的<strong>3D 动态粒子</strong>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这是基于 MorphoxL 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-block-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fancy Block Particles</a> 模组进行重制更新的版本，已移植至最新的 Minecraft 版本。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>简介</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组为游戏引入了 3D 粒子，并允许您根据个人喜好灵活自定义各项选项。如果您觉得某些粒子效果不理想，可以减少其数量或直接禁用。禁用后（通过 FBP 面板），将恢复显示原版标准粒子。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>本模组仅限安装在客户端！</strong></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>是的，您可以在整合包中使用本模组！</strong></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>粒子与动画</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>方块放置动画与破坏粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H0q8pHN.gif\" alt=\"方块破坏\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>火焰、岩浆、烟雾与营火烟雾粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JcIIAkj.gif\" alt=\"火焰与烟雾\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>萤火虫粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0xYnkah.gif\" alt=\"萤火虫\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>滴落粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24RpkCg.gif\" alt=\"滴落\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>雨滴粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7VDUAkF.gif\" alt=\"雨滴\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>雪花粒子：</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5NnVa7.gif\" alt=\"雪花\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></u></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>设置</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FBP 允许您根据个人喜好自定义最核心的破坏粒子设置。要打开 FBP 面板，请按键盘上的 <strong>I</strong> 键（默认）。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RPdhY21.png\" alt=\"菜单\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需调整，您也可以通过位于 <strong><em>config/fbp/config.json</em></strong> 的配置文件来修改设置。</span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>按键绑定</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">启用/禁用模组&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未绑定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">启用/禁用放置动画&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未绑定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">打开设置&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>I</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">切换冻结效果&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>R</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">清除粒子&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未绑定</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速将方块加入黑名单&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>X</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速将手持方块加入黑名单&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>Shift + X</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">重新加载配置&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>未绑定</strong></span></span></p>&nbsp;<p style=\"padding-left:30px;color:#8131f9\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>OptiFine/Iris 兼容性</strong></span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FBP <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">应当</span>与 OptiFine 和 Iris 兼容。</span></p><p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您发现仅在将 FBP 与 OptiFine、Iris 或其他光影模组一起使用时出现的 Bug，请在此<a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=bug&template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">反馈</a>。<strong>但是</strong>，请注意此类问题并非都能得到解决！</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>下载</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.21.11&showAlphaFiles=show\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fbp-renewed/files?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需旧版本或原版模组，请前往<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-block-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>贡献</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>发现了 Bug？</strong>请在此<a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=bug&template=bug_report.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">反馈</a>，我会尽力修复！</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>有新功能的想法？</strong>请在此<a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles/issues/new?labels=enhancement&template=feature_request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">告诉我更多细节</a>！</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>代码</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Hantonik/FancyBlockParticles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击我</a>获取</span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>源代码</strong>!<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#333;font-size:14px\">“如果你想使用我的代码，随意使用，但请记住注明代码的原作者是谁！”</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#333;font-size:14px\">保重，作者。”</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#8131f9\"><strong>支持</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fhantonik\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.buymeacoffee.com/button-api/?text=Buy me a coffee&emoji=&slug=hantonik&button_colour=BD5FFF&font_colour=ffffff&font_family=Comic&outline_colour=000000&coffee_colour=FFDD00\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>我完全是出于热爱</strong>，但如果您想支持我的作品，可以通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fhantonik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">请我喝杯咖啡</a>来表达，<strong>谢谢 &lt;3</strong>！</p>",
